{% else %}
It simply did not work in time. Nobody knows it was attempted.
{% endif %}

This is attempt {{ attempt }} of at most {{ max_attempts }}. After that they
stop whether they want to or not, so a plan that needs three more setbacks to
pay off is not a plan.

